<title>UK: Banco Inter Atlantico sets $125 million Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Banco Inter Atlantico sets $125 million Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Inter Atlantico SA has launched a $125 million three-year Eurobond, joint lead managers Credit Agricole Indosuez and Credit Agricole said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>No other details were made immediately available. Final pricing was due later.</p>
<p>The borrower is 47.08 percent owned by Credit Agricole, 23.54 percent by Banco Espirito Santo and 23.54 percent by Grupo Monteiro Aranha.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
